<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:10:35 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>星舰第一次轨道飞行测试后坠入太平洋</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/starship-splashes-down-in-the-pacific-after-1st-orbital-flight-test</link><description>周一早上从德克萨斯州南部发射了世界上最大、最强大的航天器后，SpaceX 结束了其任务，并称其成功。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/starship-splashes-down-in-the-pacific-after-1st-orbital-flight-test.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:10:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/starship-splashes-down-in-the-pacific-after-1st-orbital-flight-test</guid></item><item><title>创新速度现已成为国家安全的当务之急</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/innovation-velocity-is-now-a-national-security-imperative</link><description>布鲁克斯咨询公司的政府官员查克·布鲁克斯表示，收购速度和技术融合正在决定美国的安全。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/innovation-velocity-is-now-a-national-security-imperative.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:55:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/innovation-velocity-is-now-a-national-security-imperative</guid></item><item><title>科学家找到新方法来克服细胞对自我扩增 mRNA 疫苗的天然防御</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-find-new-way-to-overcome-cells-natural-defenses-against-self-amplifying-mrna-vaccines</link><description>这项创新可以以更低的剂量提供保护，这意味着疫苗可以比以前想象的更远、更快的速度推出，并为基因治疗、癌症免疫治疗和蛋白质替代疗法开辟新的可能性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-find-new-way-to-overcome-cells-natural-defenses-against-self-amplifying-mrna-vaccines.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:40:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-find-new-way-to-overcome-cells-natural-defenses-against-self-amplifying-mrna-vaccines</guid></item><item><title>开尔文循环定理（流体力学）不可压缩流体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/kelvins-circulation-theorem-fluid-mechanics-incompressible-fluid</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:25:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/kelvins-circulation-theorem-fluid-mechanics-incompressible-fluid</guid></item><item><title>牛顿冷却定律</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/newtons-law-of-cooling</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:10:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/newtons-law-of-cooling</guid></item><item><title>一睹太阳系的起源：陨石内部分子的惊人细节</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-glimpse-of-the-solar-systems-origins-striking-details-on-the-molecules-inside-a-meteorite</link><description>国家强磁场实验室和布鲁克海文国家实验室的研究人员联手，重新审视陨石的复杂组成，并一睹太阳系的过去。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-glimpse-of-the-solar-systems-origins-striking-details-on-the-molecules-inside-a-meteorite.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:55:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-glimpse-of-the-solar-systems-origins-striking-details-on-the-molecules-inside-a-meteorite</guid></item><item><title>血液检测趋势可能有助于识别癌症风险增加的患者</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/blood-test-trends-may-help-identify-patients-at-increased-risk-of-cancer</link><description>英国牛津大学的 Brian Nicholson 及其同事于 9 月 17 日在《PLOS Medicine》杂志上发表的一项研究表明，血液检测趋势以及不明原因的体重减轻可以改善癌症检测的分类。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/blood-test-trends-may-help-identify-patients-at-increased-risk-of-cancer.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:40:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/blood-test-trends-may-help-identify-patients-at-increased-risk-of-cancer</guid></item><item><title>超级衰老不仅仅是由于遗传性阿尔茨海默病风险较低</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/superaging-is-not-simply-due-to-low-inherited-alzheimers-disease-risk</link><description>超级老年人在 80 岁和 90 岁的时候仍能保持记忆力，新的研究表明，这不仅仅是因为遗传性阿尔茨海默病风险较低。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/superaging-is-not-simply-due-to-low-inherited-alzheimers-disease-risk.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:25:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/superaging-is-not-simply-due-to-low-inherited-alzheimers-disease-risk</guid></item><item><title>为细胞提供新鲜的线粒体有助于清除受损的线粒体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/giving-cells-fresh-mitochondria-helps-clear-damaged-ones</link><description>研究人员发现，调节线粒体维护的 BNIP3 随着年龄的增长而增加，损害心脏处理能量的能力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/giving-cells-fresh-mitochondria-helps-clear-damaged-ones.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:10:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/giving-cells-fresh-mitochondria-helps-clear-damaged-ones</guid></item><item><title>量子计算机大胆进入量子计算机从未去过的地方：太空</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/quantum-computer-boldly-goes-where-no-quantum-computer-has-gone-before-space</link><description>量子世界有重大消息。量子计算机首次在太空中使用。该设备搭载在近地轨道上的航天器上，并展示了最终可以帮助解决困扰卫星多年的问题的技术。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/quantum-computer-boldly-goes-where-no-quantum-computer-has-gone-before-space2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:55:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/quantum-computer-boldly-goes-where-no-quantum-computer-has-gone-before-space</guid></item></channel></rss>